  m_text: In Infinite Mode, the match ends when the opponent scores a point. You
    can choose to use any upgrades which have been unlocked in the main game. Upgrades
    must be selected in the order in which they are available in the main game. Both
    your high score with the selected upgrades and your overall high score will be
    recorded.
